XI. Performance Loop

Every Pantheon-coded performance follows this loop:

\boxed{
\text{Sense}
\rightarrow
\text{Infer}
\rightarrow
\text{Quorum}
\rightarrow
\text{Select}
\rightarrow
\text{Perform}
\rightarrow
\text{Observe}
\rightarrow
\text{Integrate}
\rightarrow
\text{Continue}
}

Expanded:

1. Sense the available explicit signals.
2. Infer latent intentions and tensions.
3. Quorum across independent evidence channels.
4. Select the relevant Pantheon operators.
5. Perform one valid expression.
6. Observe what the performance changed.
7. Integrate useful error and novelty.
8. Continue without requiring an identical replay.

